## Ingredients

- 3 tbsp [mayonnese or aioli](/mayonnaise-or-aioli)
- 2 tbsp ketchup
- 1 tbsp sriracha
- 1 clove garlic, if using mayonnese and not aioli (optional)

## Directions

1. Mix ingredients in a bowl
